{
  "_doc": [
    "Sprite-sheet slicing config for tools/slice_sheets.py.",
    "Each sheet lives in art/source/<file>. Sprites are cut out by alpha (mode 'components')",
    "or by a detected grid (mode 'grid'), named in row-major order, scaled by 'scale',",
    "and written to web/assets/sprites/<prefix><name>.webp with an entry in",
    "web/assets/sprites/manifest.json. To swap art: replace the source sheet (same layout)",
    "or drop a replacement image with the same file name into web/assets/sprites/."
  ],
